"file_name": "Rumblekin_Gameplay_2026-09-02_17-55-11-201.png", "id": "1095967619639105", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831393_1095967622972438_1143164031269731681_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Le1OIQ-dr7EQ7kNvwF0l31K&_nc_oc=AdoCRTfUiPBd2ImtEI39ojbZ4pDBPjdwd0LBPHrxZhupVfNx56FsgvaEGm_w4knmjtM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQFNCAh5mQGpD6Znn2NX1OlN7NJDjeQsNRWtQ3OEv0xQA&oe=6AFDD0E5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Rumblekin VR", "keywords": ["destruction", "Sandbox", "physics", "monster", "city"], "long_description": "Become Rumblekin and unleash your strength across a reactive city built for physical VR action.\n\nMove with your arms, climb the environment, punch structures, grab objects, and throw them back into the world. Every impact delivers oversized arcade feedback as buildings shake, break apart, and collapse into persistent ruins.\n\nGrow through increasingly powerful forms, opening new ways to tear through streets, vehicles, and city structures. Cause chaos your way: strike with your fists, use the environment as a weapon, and turn each encounter into a destructive playground.\n\nRumblekin VR is a single-player arcade action experience focused on scale, momentum, impact, and satisfying destruction.", "short_description": "Grow stronger, smash through a living city, and unleash arcade destruction in this physical VR action game."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://leafandlight.github.io/rumblekin-vr-site/privacy/?lang=en", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Leaf & Light Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://leafandlight.github.io/rumblekin-vr-site/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"i